Package: com.hmmzzz.marktheme64e
Name: MarkTheme64e
Version: 0.1.9-64e-b1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Modular Theme Engine & Manager for Modern Jailbreaks
 MarkTheme64e is a powerful, lightweight theme manager built for iOS 16.0+
 rootless and RootHide environments.
 .
 Features:
  * Full SnowBoard & IconBundles theme import support.
  * Themes Home Screen icons, folders, badges, Spotlight, and Settings.
  * Themes Phone UI, Photo/System Sharing sheets, and Status Bar.
  * Supports custom author masks and native system rounded corner masks.
 .
 Architecture & Performance:
  * All theme parsing and compilation happens securely in the Manager App.
  * The injected tweak process runs a heavily optimized, minimal runtime.
  * Pre-installation validation for archives, manifests, and image resources.
  * Safe Fallback: Automatically reverts to the native system appearance if
    identity, ABI, or resource validation fails.
 .
 Important Notes:
  * Available as separate Rootless (Dopamine) and RootHide (Relaxin) packages.
  * Do NOT mix packages. Install the one matching your specific environment.
